 # Changelog
 
+## [v0.1.40-test.1] - 2026-11-26
+
+> R53 bounded retry for transient receiver-store I/O. Corrupt or invalid configuration remains fail-closed; this does not claim to fix E2LB startup.
+
+### English
+- Retry transient `IOException` while loading or first-writing the private receiver configuration store, with a maximum of three attempts and bounded 100/250 ms backoff.
+- Do not retry malformed JSON, schema mismatch, invalid secret length, validation failures, or interrupted operations.
+- Expose the number of storage retries in the redacted receiver-detection summary.
+- Add exact-source tests for transient recovery, bounded exhaustion, malformed-store fail-fast, and interruption handling.
+- Full Android Gradle build and E2LB real-vehicle behavior remain unverified.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 本机接收端配置存储读取或首次写入遇到临时 `IOException` 时，最多重试三次，退避间隔为 100/250 毫秒。
+- JSON 损坏、schema 不匹配、密钥长度错误、数据校验失败及线程中断均不重试，继续安全失败。
+- 在脱敏的接收端诊断摘要中记录本次存储初始化重试次数。
+- 新增临时 I/O 恢复、重试上限、损坏配置快速失败和中断处理测试。
+- 完整 Android 编译与 E2LB 实车行为仍未验证。
+
 ## [v0.1.39-test.1] - 2026-11-26
 
 > R52 bounded receiver-store readiness. This closes a cold-start race that could disable receiver-scoped experiment memory on the first Bluetooth attempt; it does not claim to fix the E2LB vehicle connection.
